      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You must align your company's stance with the legislation and publicly support it. Remaining neutral in the face of such a critical social issue is perceived as complicity by your core demographic and signals weakness. Supporting the reform demonstrates genuine commitment to the values your customers hold dear, which is essential for long-term brand loyalty.",
