      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A middle ground is a dangerous, ineffective strategy in today's polarized climate; it signals weakness and indecision to everyone. If your core demographic demands support, then that is where your primary focus must be, as they drive your business. Trying to appease both sides guarantees you satisfy neither, leading to a diluted, inauthentic brand message.",
      "source": "target",
